      "filename": "USS Constitution fires its cannons as it is tugged through Boston Harbor. (51200023793) (cropped).jpg",
      "title": "File:USS Constitution fires its cannons as it is tugged through Boston Harbor. (51200023793) (cropped).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/USS_Constitution_fires_its_cannons_as_it_is_tugged_through_Boston_Harbor._%2851200023793%29_%28cropped%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:USS_Constitution_fires_its_cannons_as_it_is_tugged_through_Boston_Harbor._(51200023793)_(cropped).jpg",
