      "description": "Accession: 83-166-C\nCopper Spike, Section\n2\"L \nCopper, Oak\nCopper spike mounted on oak base taken from the USF CONSTITUTION in 1926 during a refit. The CONSTITUTION was launched in 1797 and is still commissioned. She is berthed in Boston and can be visited.\n\nCollection of Curator Branch, Naval History and Heritage Command.",
